exit: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
usage: riftc <command> [options] [file]

commands:
  lex <file>        print the token stream of a .rifts/.rifth file
  check <file>      check a file for errors (currently: lexing)
  explain [code]    describe a diagnostic code, or list all codes

options:
  --diagnostic-format=human|short   diagnostic layout (default: human)
  --color=auto|always|never         colored diagnostics (default: auto)
  -h, --help                        show this help
  -V, --version                     show the compiler version

exit codes: 0 success, 1 errors in input, 2 bad command line, 3 internal error
